      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's true that therapy offers a safe space, but it's also a place to deeply examine the weight of your own internal reality. Your feeling of being a 'parasite' speaks to a profound sense of worthlessness, and that feeling is incredibly painful. Instead of trying to argue against the feeling, perhaps you could explore what that feeling is trying to tell you about your own needs or fears. A therapist can help you unpack the source of this intense self-judgment.",
      "source": "target",
